      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Jiu: Azhdaha",
      "content": "Azhdaha is the ancient dragon sealed beneath the Dragon-Queller. Jiu is the part of him that is rage and a wish for revenge. A second part, his goodwill and memory, escaped to find Morax and possessed Kun Jun, but forgot its purpose except to seek Dragonfall.\n\nThe two halves were a schism of one will. Kun Jun's half remembered coexistence with humanity; Jiu's remembered only betrayal.",
