    "2": {
      "uid": 2,
      "key": [
        "Dragon-Queller",
        "ancient tree",
        "the tree"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Jiu: The Dragon-Queller",
      "content": "A massive tree between Mt. Hulao and Nantianmen, with blue veins and ghostly blue branches. A nearby tablet records that the adepti sealed an 'evil dragon' beneath it. Jiu claims the tree and beast are becoming one, and that when the dragon rises it will consume the tree and draw on the ley lines.\n\nIn 'No Mere Stone' the Traveler enters the domain beneath the tree and fights the sealed Azhdaha. After the fight the miners are found exhausted but unharmed.",
